mode: "100644"
text: "# North star by channel, cascades + two worked examples\n\n## North Star by channel (win conditions)\n| Channel | Primary role | North Star | Supporting |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| TikTok / Reels / Shorts | awareness/discovery | reach / qualified views | shares, completion |\n| Instagram | engagement/community | engagement rate by reach | saves, profile visits |\n| LinkedIn | consideration | CTR / link clicks | dwell, comments |\n| YouTube (long) | consideration/authority | watch time / retention | subs, CTR |\n| Pinterest | traffic | outbound clicks | saves, impressions |\n| X | conversation/authority | replies/bookmarks | profile clicks |\n| Facebook | community/discovery | saves+shares (Reels: reach) | comments |\n\n## Goal → objective → KPI cascades (with guardrails)\n| Business goal | SMART objective (example) | KPI(s) | Guardrail |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Brand awareness | unaided awareness 18% → 30% by Dec 2026 | reach, share of voice, branded search | ER not collapsing |\n| Community/affinity | IG ER 1.8% → 3.5% + 45k → 80k followers by Q4 | ER, follower-growth-rate, saves/shares | 3%+ ER floor |\n| Traffic | organic sessions 85k → 150k/mo by Q4 | clicks/CTR, UTM sessions | bounce rate |\n| Leads | 1,400 → 2,500 MQLs/mo by Q3 | MQLs by channel, cost/lead | lead-to-opp rate (quality) |\n| Sales | social-attributed revenue +20% by Q3 | CVR, social-attributed revenue | CPA ceiling |\n| Retention/care | response time 10m → 2m by next quarter | response time, resolution rate | sentiment |\n\n## Setting the target (from benchmark, not fantasy)\n1. Pull the **baseline** (last 30–90 days, native analytics). 2. Set **achievable-yet-ambitious** lift\nfrom it (e.g. +15–25% on a leading metric). 3. Add a **guardrail** quality floor. 4. Add an **action\nthreshold**. No baseline → a **learning goal** (establish the baseline first; comparable benchmarks are\nprovisional only).\n\n## Worked example 1 — focused quarter (blunt indie-founder voice)\n```\nBUSINESS GOAL: more trial sign-ups.\nOBJECTIVE (SMART): newsletter sign-ups from social 200 → 300/mo by Q3 2026.\nNORTH STAR: IG = ER by reach; Pinterest = outbound clicks. SUPPORTING: saves, UTM sessions.\nTARGET: from a 210/mo baseline; +43% is a stretch but trend supports it. GUARDRAIL: hold 3%+ ER.\nTRIGGER: clicks flat 2 wks -> change the CTA/offer. CADENCE: weekly metric, monthly tactic, quarterly goal.\nHANDOFF: analytics-and-reporting measures.\n```\n\n## Worked example 2 — new-account learning goal (warm studio voice)\n```\nSITUATION: brand-new account, no baseline.\nLEARNING GOAL (90 days): publish 4x/week, establish baseline reach + ER per platform; no numeric target yet.\nPROVISIONAL GUIDE: industry ER ranges (flagged provisional, not a promise).\nTHEN: set Q2 SMART targets from the 90-day baseline. NORTH STAR (provisional): IG ER, TikTok reach.\n```\n\nBoth: anchored to a business outcome; SMART; benchmark-set (or learning goal); one North Star per\nchannel + guardrail; capped + triggered; handed to `analytics-and-reporting` to measure.\n"
